shi-012","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize-ws2060595"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:r0034","surface":"廢帝","start":34,"end":36,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001","quote":"廢帝王皇后，琅邪臨沂人也。天嘉元年，為皇太子妃。廢帝即位，立為皇后。廢帝為臨海王，后廢為妃。至德中薨。后生臨海嗣王至澤。至澤，光大元年為皇太子，太建元年，襲封臨海嗣王。陳亡，入長安。后父固自有傳。","note":"王氏本名未載。廢帝與臨海王是伯宗，嗣王是其子至澤。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize-ws2060595"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:r0037","surface":"臨海王","start":37,"end":40,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001","quote":"廢帝王皇后，琅邪臨沂人也。天嘉元年，為皇太子妃。廢帝即位，立為皇后。廢帝為臨海王，后廢為妃。至德中薨。后生臨海嗣王至澤。至澤，光大元年為皇太子，太建元年，襲封臨海嗣王。陳亡，入長安。后父固自有傳。","note":"王氏本名未載。廢帝與臨海王是伯宗，嗣王是其子至澤。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize-ws2060595"},{"start":92,"end":94,"surface":"太子","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001:r0092","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang:p001","person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"瑒字子瑛，沈靜有器局，美風儀。梁元帝時，位太子中庶子。陳武帝入輔，以爲司徒左長史。文帝即位，累遷太子中庶子、散騎常侍、侍中。父沖嘗爲瑒辭領中庶子，文帝顧沖曰：「所以久留瑒于承華，正欲使太子微有瑒風法耳。」","note":"本句按敘述視點回指伯宗。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyang","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangyang-ws1752646"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p002:r0088","surface":"皇太子","start":88,"end":91,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p002","quote":"承聖元年，為太子中庶子，遷尋陽太守。魏克荊州，固之鄱陽，隨兄質度東嶺，居信安縣。陳永定中，移居吳郡。文帝以固清靜，且欲申以婚姻。天嘉中，歷位中書令，散騎常侍，國子祭酒。以其女為皇太子妃，禮遇甚重。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003:r0000","surface":"廢帝","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003","quote":"廢帝即位，授侍中、金紫光祿大夫。宣帝輔政，固以廢帝外戚，奶媼恒往來禁中，頗宣密旨，事泄，比黨皆誅，宣帝以固本無兵權，且居處清素，止免所居官，禁錮。太建中，卒于太常卿，諡恭子。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003:r0023","surface":"廢帝","start":23,"end":25,"person_id":"2mj_6rl_6xs","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian:p003","quote":"廢帝即位，授侍中、金紫光祿大夫。宣帝輔政，固以廢帝外戚，奶媼恒往來禁中，頗宣密旨，事泄，比黨皆誅，宣帝以固本無兵權，且居處清素，止免所居官，禁錮。太建中，卒于太常卿，諡恭子。","note":"按傳主、各朝年月、明文親稱與皇太子世系。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wanggu-zijian-ws2478204"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-003-wang-empress-marriage-annal:p001","text":"秋七月己丑，皇太子納妃王氏。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-003-wang-empress-marriage-annal:p001:m0011","surface":"王氏","start":11,"end":13,"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2361318,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":87,"last_line":87,"line_start":2,"line_end":16,"raw_start":6364,"raw_end":6378,"raw_character_offsets":[6364,6365,6366,6367,6368,6369,6370,6371,6372,6373,6374,6375,6376,6377],"projection_sha256":"d8b37e3794f3c6a8f8dd6b073ac2f5d0a1b5ed634e80d53f819c7940dce7312d"},"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-003-wang-empress-marriage-annal","book_id":"b-chenshu-003","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-003